versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

status.description:
The status of this purchase order line.
By default all the order lines begin as {@link PurchaseOrderLineStatusEnum#PENDING}
When {#quantityReceived} is equal to {#quantity} for this order line, it can be considered as {@link PurchaseOrderLineStatusEnum#COMPLETED}.
